invariant: INV-64
file: srv_mldsa.c
catches: cnsa2_server_test
reason: the configuration check takes a secret key one byte shorter than
  the 4,896 bytes mldsa87_sign reads, so a session would hand the signer a
  buffer shorter than it reads. test_identity_and_cpu requires
  srv_config_ok to refuse priv_len 4895.

--- old
    return id->priv_len == MLDSA87_SK_LEN && id->pub_len == MLDSA87_PK_LEN;
--- new
    return id->priv_len >= MLDSA87_SK_LEN - 1 && id->pub_len == MLDSA87_PK_LEN;
